OL,3,GNEWSAHouse explosion leaves man
OL,4,Acritically injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is fighting for his life in
OL,7,Fhospital following a house explosion in
OL,8,FManchester.
OL,10,FFire crews and police were called to
OL,11,FAsh Street in the Harpurhey area
OL,12,Ffollowing the blast at about 10:20 BST.
OL,14,FGreater Manchester Police said the man
OL,15,Fwas critically injured and taken to
OL,16,Fhospital.
OL,18,FNeighbouring properties were evacuated
OL,19,Fand a woman was also treated for what
OL,20,Fpolice said were thought to be minor
OL,21,Finjuries.
